    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Hi-Speed Jecy",
        "jpn": "ハイスピード・ジェシー"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Jecy is a young man whose parents were murdered by an organized crime syndicate, now he's on a quest for revenge. With incredible abilities such as increased speed and agility, Jecy travels through space with a girl named Tiana, a priest named Fork Green, and a living ship called Paolon. However, between Jecy any his revenge is a woman named Jera, her bloodthirsty little brother Cross and a number of other adversaries.",
        "jpn": "超人的な俊足を持つ少年ジェシーが妹のティアナ、異星文明により生み出された生体宇宙船パオロンと共に両親の敵であるビスマークを追う。"
    },
